'''11th Anniversary Dummy''' is an animated enemy base found in the [[Catclaw Dojo]] during the 11th Anniversary Party Event. It was added in [[Version 13.0 Update|Version 13.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 11th Anniversary Dummy
|image = E 673.png
|first appearance = [[Catclaw Dojo]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy base can attack Cat Units in its range with a slow attack rate. Because it is a base, it does not move, similar to the [[Sunrise Doge|Sun Doge]] and [[Ritual Drum Doge]]. All of its attacks are instant-kill, although [[Glass Cat (Rare Cat)|Glass Cat]] and [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] can survive due to having the [[Special Abilities|Metal ability]]. Like [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]], this enemy is immune to all abilities because it is an enemy base.

